WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.124 --> 00:00:01.940
- Do you play cards, do you gamble?

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.950
- No, I do Wheel of Fortune slot machines.

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:06.740
- All right well,
- I love them.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.090
- Hopefully you know at least-
- Like an old lady.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.901
- The aces are obviously a
good card to have as you know?

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:12.734
- Yes

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:14.310
- Okay so watch, I'm gonna
grab the aces like this.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.400
Okay, ready?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.690
One, two, three.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:19.581
- [Kelly] Uh, I'm sorry.

00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:21.600
- All four aces just come out like that.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.831
But tell you what,

00:00:22.831 --> 00:00:25.207
I don't wanna use the aces.
- Okay.

00:00:25.207 --> 00:00:26.720
- You know why?

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.497
- It was just too easy
to fly out anywhere?

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:29.330
- No, it's not that.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.500
It's just it's too cliche

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.860
and everyone thinks about the aces.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.693
- Yeah.

00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:34.300
- Okay so tell you
what, not just the aces.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.680
Okay, focus on the back design as well.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.810
I'll tell you, we'll get rid of the aces.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.220
So Kelly, hand out like this.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.527
Okay great, okay you're
gonna hold on to the aces.

00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:41.460
- [Kelly] I have really
dry hands I'm sorry.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:42.900
- Make sure I don't go
anywhere near those cards

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.733
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:44.566
- Keep it really closed and tight.

00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:45.399
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:46.320
- Now, Max, I wanna use you.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.520
Big fan by the way.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.927
- Oh god, thank you,

00:00:48.927 --> 00:00:50.528
but I'm also nervous.

00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:51.940
- All the cards here are different.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.520
Do you have a thought
of card in your head?

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.550
Do you have one?

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.292
- All these cards.
- Sure, yes.

00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:57.180
- Cause I have no idea, these guys,

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:58.130
no one in the house knows.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.460
So just go ahead and say out the card.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.140
What was the card that you're thinking of?

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:01.990
- Three of diamonds.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.001
- Three of diamonds, okay watch.

00:01:03.001 --> 00:01:04.880
- No way.
- All right, well watch.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.160
Nothings happened yet.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.139
- I'm just saying no way.

00:01:07.139 --> 00:01:07.972
- Okay.

00:01:07.972 --> 00:01:08.805
(laughing)

00:01:08.805 --> 00:01:10.510
All right, watch the seven, okay?

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:11.343
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:11.343 --> 00:01:12.480
- You'll actually see this happen.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.356
You'll see me actually take
out the three of diamonds

00:01:14.356 --> 00:01:16.803
inside the middle of the deck,

00:01:16.803 --> 00:01:19.660
and place it right over here.

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:20.716
(audience applauding)

00:01:20.716 --> 00:01:21.788
- What?!

00:01:21.788 --> 00:01:25.270
- Look but that's not the crazy part.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.640
- How is that not the crazy part?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.570
- That's not the crazy part,

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:28.585
the crazy part is,

00:01:28.585 --> 00:01:31.120
I cannot just make one card, okay watch.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.480
I cannot just make one card,

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.927
I'll make every single card-

00:01:35.927 --> 00:01:36.760
- How did that just happen,

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.043
you were sitting right here.

00:01:38.043 --> 00:01:38.876
(audience applauding)

00:01:38.876 --> 00:01:42.887
Every single card turned
into the three of diamonds.

00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:43.977
But wait, Kelly,

00:01:43.977 --> 00:01:47.170
you should feel those aces
slowly melting together,

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.520
into a single card.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:49.353
Can you rub it?

00:01:49.353 --> 00:01:50.725
It's a single card right now.

00:01:50.725 --> 00:01:53.410
- How the hell did you do that?

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:54.990
- Max, three of diamonds right?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:55.823
- I see a three of diamonds.

00:01:55.823 --> 00:01:57.641
- Open up your hand.
- No way.

00:01:57.641 --> 00:01:58.933
- Open up your hand.

00:01:58.933 --> 00:02:00.623
- I don't want to.

00:02:00.623 --> 00:02:02.836
Oh god, oh my god!

00:02:02.836 --> 00:02:05.337
(audience applauding)

00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:07.720
- But now, I know what
you guys are thinking.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.750
You're thinking okay, Shin,

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.390
see now all the cards are the same right

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:11.890
and before they were all different

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:12.910
when I first started, right?

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:13.743
- That's what I'm thinking, dude.

00:02:13.743 --> 00:02:15.670
- Yeah yeah, but that's not the case.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.930
See even though it's all
the same on the face,

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.940
they're still very very
different on the backs.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.623
Every single card in Las Vegas

00:02:23.623 --> 00:02:25.384
is different from the back.

00:02:25.384 --> 00:02:26.217
(audience applauding)

00:02:26.217 --> 00:02:27.720
And now that these cards
are different, right?

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.553
Tell you what,

00:02:28.553 --> 00:02:29.710
Kelly just say stop as I do this,

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.543
okay go ahead.

00:02:30.543 --> 00:02:31.780
- What, just do this?
- No no no,

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.970
say stop as I do this.
- Oh.

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.486
- You're like me

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:35.319
- Okay, stop.

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:36.152
- Right there, okay.

00:02:36.152 --> 00:02:36.985
Guy over there in the back,

00:02:36.985 --> 00:02:38.930
I'm gonna just say the
random hotels, okay?

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:39.763
The Rio,

00:02:39.763 --> 00:02:40.990
Golden Nugget, MGM Grand,

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.180
Caesars Palace, Excalibur,

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.591
go ahead, just say one.

00:02:43.591 --> 00:02:44.540
- [Man] MGM.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.373
- MGM, okay great,

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:46.715
right we'll grab the MGM Grand.

00:02:46.715 --> 00:02:48.763
Watch the MGM.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.217
I can take the actual hotel...

00:02:52.217 --> 00:02:54.676
(dramatic music)

00:02:54.676 --> 00:02:55.509
- What?!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.577
- Kelly, I didn't go anywhere
near that card did I?

00:02:59.577 --> 00:03:01.970
- No, I don't think so.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.980
- It slightly got just
a little bit thicker.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.340
Tear the card right in the middle.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.173
- I don't like this.

00:03:07.173 --> 00:03:08.257
- Just gently tear it in the middle.

00:03:08.257 --> 00:03:10.105
No, no, no, tear it midway through

00:03:10.105 --> 00:03:11.250
