00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.083
- Tear it?
- Yeah, go ahead.

00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:13.370
Do you see one card?

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.677
Here, I'll help you.

00:03:14.677 --> 00:03:15.680
(screaming)

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.920
No, no, no!
- What just happened?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.244
- Careful, it's a delicate card,

00:03:18.244 --> 00:03:19.077
I'll show you.

00:03:19.077 --> 00:03:20.002
- Oh my god, oh my god, wait what?

00:03:20.002 --> 00:03:20.835
- Can you see this?

00:03:20.835 --> 00:03:23.790
It looks a lot like the
MGM Grand to me I think.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.623
Let me just see.

00:03:24.623 --> 00:03:25.876
- My mind is blown, dude.

00:03:25.876 --> 00:03:29.043
(audience applauding)

00:03:31.185 --> 00:03:32.860
- Thank you so much!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:33.810
That was the trick.

00:03:36.385 --> 00:03:37.972
- I don't even know what to do right now.

00:03:37.972 --> 00:03:38.987
- Ah that's okay,
- I'm so impressed with you.

00:03:38.987 --> 00:03:40.010
- You don't have to do
anything, that's fine.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.860
- Does he magically get a room there?

